Additional note regarding the TYT/MD-390 Plus: The "Quick Menu" option is available by pressing the "SK1" keys + the "green" button. On my "TYT 390 Plus," I have to press the green button a second time (while holding down the SK1 button) to activate the menu.<br><br>I've run numerous tests since yesterday, and it's always the same. Sometimes pressing the green button once is enough, but 90% of the time, I have to press it a second time. This doesn't happen with other SK1 key combinations, and I also have no problem using the green button to access the menus. It's really the combination of these two keys that seems to be causing the problem with my TYT 390 Plus.<br><br>Yves,<br>ve2ymm.com<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=7035">ve2ymm</a> — Sun May 25, 2025 12:41 pm</p><hr />
